    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1252">

                <pb facs="1242" n="1232" xml:id="pg1232"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.0093/2–2849: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Philippines</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Lockett</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Manila</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-02-28">February 28,
                        1949</date>.<lb/>[Received February 28—12:31 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>505. For FA.<anchor n="43" xml:id="d1252-f1"/> Evacuées PU area Monday February
                    28: State 41; Army none; Navy none; Air none; ECA 8;<anchor n="44"
                        xml:id="d1252-f2"/> total 49.</p>
                <p>The PU area will close as of midnight tonight and the remaining evacuees
                    established in quarters in the Military Plaza compound.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lockett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
